    <node id="Kremarel Partners">
      <data key="d0">Kremarel Partners</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Kremarel Partners is a vendor with a 24-month master services agreement that is up for renewal in Q1 FY27. The company is being reviewed to determine if the scope of the agreement still aligns with organizational needs.&lt;SEP&gt;A vendor with a $2.8M contract to deliver equipment and provide services to Zastama Industries.&lt;SEP&gt;An external vendor delivering equipment to the Kimmoine Annex. The deliveries are routine and important for keeping the site supplied.&lt;SEP&gt;An external vendor with which Zastama Industries has a 24-month master services agreement. Teams considering work under this arrangement should consult with procurement and legal contacts to confirm scope and avoid conflicts.&lt;SEP&gt;An external vendor with a 24-month master services agreement with Zastama Industries, requiring special review for access to internal systems.</data>
