    <node id="Nalzenett Labs">
      <data key="d0">Nalzenett Labs</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Nalzenett Labs is a vendor up for renewal in Q2 FY27. A similar review will be conducted for this vendor after the renewal process for Kremarel Partners is underway.&lt;SEP&gt;Nalzenett Labs is an external organization that supplies components for the Lagemett Ledger.&lt;SEP&gt;An organization whose terms are being reviewed for potential updates before renewal.&lt;SEP&gt;A vendor with a contract set to renew in Q2 FY27. The renewal is earlier than Misginine Systems and will be reviewed for usage, cost, and potential renegotiation or scope changes.&lt;SEP&gt;A customer of Zastama Industries whose contract is up for renewal in Q2 FY27.&lt;SEP&gt;A supplier of components for the Lagemett Ledger, with a constructive working relationship with Zastama Industries.</data>
