    <node id="Getaine Hebruen">
      <data key="d0">Getaine Hebruen</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Getaine Hebruen is an employee who joined the company in 2019 and focuses on data retention tooling. She is the contact for questions related to record retention, archiving, and deletion requests.&lt;SEP&gt;Getaine Hebruen is a member of the Dankenor Analytics Unit and reports to Krilfia Mukela. He is responsible for answering day-to-day telemetry questions and is part of the reporting line for telemetry requests.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-002-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-019-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">d-public-002&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-019</data>
