    <node id="Gonnom Gosmunza">
      <data key="d0">Gonnom Gosmunza</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Gonnom Gosmunza is an employee who focuses on identity and access tooling. He is the contact for questions about account provisioning, permission changes, and access reviews.&lt;SEP&gt;A new employee who joined Zastama Industries in 2023 and has since contributed to the company's work.&lt;SEP&gt;A Director of Engineering at Zastama Industries and a member of the Dankenor Analytics Unit, focusing on identity and access tooling.&lt;SEP&gt;Gonnom Gosmunza is a Director of Engineering at Zastama Industries. He is responsible for addressing engineering-wide questions, such as cross-team technical priorities and staffing across engineering groups.&lt;SEP&gt;A Director of Engineering at Zastama Industries who serves as a contact for broader engineering questions related to identity and access tooling.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-002-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-003-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-016-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-019-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-013-chunk-000</data>
