      <data key="d5">1793369385</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Project Nuzeor">
      <data key="d0">Project Nuzeor</data>
      <data key="d1">project</data>
      <data key="d2">Project Nuzeor is a project led by Leroror Lukaine. Teams whose work overlaps with or could be affected by the vendor renewals are encouraged to contact the project leader.&lt;SEP&gt;A project currently paused pending review, with a target completion date of Q3 FY26. It is being reviewed to ensure it can restart on firm footing.&lt;SEP&gt;A project at Zastama Industries targeting completion in Q3 FY26, with a focus on managing dependencies and risks.&lt;SEP&gt;A project for which dependency risks are being collected and evaluated for potential threats to the Q3 FY26 target.&lt;SEP&gt;A project for which support needs are being collected and shared company-wide.&lt;SEP&gt;A project with a target completion date of Q3 FY26. The team is to regularly check vendor deliverables against the schedule to avoid late surprises.&lt;SEP&gt;A project led by Leroror Lukaine, part of the broader work described in the status report.</data>
