    <node id="Misginine Systems">
      <data key="d0">Misginine Systems</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">A vendor that supplies components for the Lagemett Ledger at Zastama Industries.&lt;SEP&gt;A vendor with which Zastama Industries has a services contract for Project Stebril.&lt;SEP&gt;Misginine Systems is a vendor whose contract is up for renewal in Q4 FY28. Teams that rely on the vendor are encouraged to provide feedback and input to inform renewal decisions.&lt;SEP&gt;A vendor with which Project Rakresett has a services contract and was discussed in the meeting for governance and coordination.&lt;SEP&gt;An organization supplying components to the Lagemett Ledger.&lt;SEP&gt;A vendor with a 24-month master services agreement worth $1.4M with Zastama Industries, set to renew in Q4 FY28. It supplies components for the Lagemett Ledger and supports Project Rakresett.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-000-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-005-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-019-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-018-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-008-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-008-chunk-001</data>
