    <node id="Dilhas Consulting">
      <data key="d0">Dilhas Consulting</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">A vendor that supplies components for the Lagemett Ledger and holds a 24-month master services agreement with Zastama Industries.&lt;SEP&gt;An external organization responsible for delivering equipment to the Tegurine Annex. Its role ends at the point of handoff and does not include installation, configuration, or testing.&lt;SEP&gt;An external vendor with a $6.5M contract to support Project Siduris.&lt;SEP&gt;A consulting organization engaged by Zastama Industries with a contract valued at $6.5M. The cost center assigned to this engagement is BT-9828-L.&lt;SEP&gt;An organization supplying components to the Lagemett Ledger.&lt;SEP&gt;A vendor that supplies components for the Lagemett Ledger. It is discussed alongside Misginine Systems as a second vendor for the same platform, requiring coordination and clear ownership of interfaces.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-000-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-001-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-004-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-007-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-008-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-008-chunk-001</data>
