      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">An employee at Zastama Industries to whom Desgua Stebela reports.&lt;SEP&gt;Berruan Zenresan is the project lead for Project Stebril and a member of the Dankenor Analytics Unit. They set the direction for the project and are the first point of contact for questions about scope and timing.&lt;SEP&gt;The Head of Security at Zastama Industries, responsible for the overall direction of the security program and customer onboarding flows.&lt;SEP&gt;The leader of Project Stebril at Zastama Industries.</data>
