      <data key="d0">Pivoine Geltoett</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">An employee at Zastama Industries who focuses on demand forecasting models and is a contact for questions about projected demand and its assumptions.&lt;SEP&gt;A member of the Dankenor Analytics Unit. She contributes to decision-making across the business through analytical support.&lt;SEP&gt;An employee at Zastama Industries who reports to Munnam Furzil and is involved in cross-team requests.&lt;SEP&gt;Pivoine Geltoett is a member of the Dankenor Analytics Unit and focuses on demand forecasting models. They report to Munnam Furzil, ensuring forecasting work is supported by an architectural perspective.</data>
