    <node id="Givien Mubren">
      <data key="d0">Givien Mubren</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A member of the Gelgos Infrastructure Team at Zastama Industries who assists with routing requests related to the underlying infrastructure of shared systems.&lt;SEP&gt;A person based at the Kimmoine Annex. Colleagues who need to coordinate on-site matters or reach someone physically present at the Kimmoine Annex can start with Givien Mubren.&lt;SEP&gt;Givien Mubren is the leader of Project Bilfael, a separate analytics project from Project Vebamett.&lt;SEP&gt;A member of the Gelgos Infrastructure Team who collaborates with security and incident response colleagues on technical issues.&lt;SEP&gt;A Product Manager at Zastama Industries who leads Project Bilfael and is responsible for its scope, priorities, and overall direction.&lt;SEP&gt;An employee based at the Kimmoine Annex who participated in the meeting and discussed site coordination and information distribution.&lt;SEP&gt;The head of the Gelgos Infrastructure Team, who also works directly within the team and is the point of contact for escalated issues or proposed changes.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-000-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-009-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-010-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-012-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-015-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-018-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-013-chunk-000</data>
