      <data key="d0">Gelgos Infrastructure Team</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">A team at Zastama Industries responsible for the underlying infrastructure that supports shared systems.&lt;SEP&gt;A team that maintains core systems and works out of the Brerponen Annex. They are responsible for day-to-day coordination and routine upkeep of the systems.&lt;SEP&gt;A team within Zastama Industries responsible for managing the underlying platforms and infrastructure.&lt;SEP&gt;The team at Zastama Industries responsible for identity and access tooling, including systems for proving identity and managing access permissions.&lt;SEP&gt;A team at Zastama Industries responsible for identity and access tooling.</data>
