      <data key="d0">Procurement</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Procurement is an organization or department within Zastama Industries responsible for vendor-related process updates.&lt;SEP&gt;A department or function at Zastama Industries responsible for managing vendor agreements and engagements.&lt;SEP&gt;A department within Zastama Industries that supports contract reviews and vendor coordination.&lt;SEP&gt;The process of acquiring goods or services, often involving contract references.&lt;SEP&gt;Procurement is the department responsible for preparing a summary of deliverables, payment structure, and renewal mechanics for the Satisen Labs contract to be presented to the Program Oversight Committee.</data>
