      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">A 24-month agreement between Zastama Industries and Dilhas Consulting that outlines the framework for work scoping, requesting, and reviewing.&lt;SEP&gt;A 36-month agreement between Zastama Industries and Satisen Labs that provides a stable framework for the services received.&lt;SEP&gt;A type of contract between Zastama Industries and Kremarel Partners that outlines the terms of their 24-month engagement. It is important to verify the scope of work under this agreement before making commitments.&lt;SEP&gt;A formal agreement that outlines the terms and conditions between parties involved in a project.&lt;SEP&gt;A 24-month contract between Zastama Industries and Misginine Systems, worth $1.4M, set to renew in Q4 FY28. It is to be reviewed alongside the services contract for Project Rakresett.</data>
