    <node id="Brerponen Annex">
      <data key="d0">Brerponen Annex</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">A workplace facility opened in 2019 with a capacity for 390 seats. It is one of the most important shared work locations at Zastama Industries and is used by the Gelgos Infrastructure Team.&lt;SEP&gt;A location where the Fonathe Platform Group is based and supports other teams.&lt;SEP&gt;The Brerponen Annex is a location in the coastal region where the Fonathe Platform Group works. It is a shared site where in-person meetings with the group can be arranged after coordination with facilities.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-001-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-003-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-014-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">d-public-001&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-003&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-014</data>
      <data key="d5">1793369436</data>
