    </node>
    <node id="Fibrasine Relay">
      <data key="d0">Fibrasine Relay</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">An internal service with about 400 active users. It is one of the more widely adopted services at Zastama Industries and is used as the foundation for Project Bilfael.&lt;SEP&gt;A system hosted at the Kimmoine Annex. It is important to consider its physical location when troubleshooting or planning changes that might affect it.&lt;SEP&gt;A system or tool with approximately 400 active users, for which access changes need to be planned with consideration for its user base size.&lt;SEP&gt;The Fibrasine Relay is a system hosted at the Kimmoine Annex. It is used by teams that depend on it, either directly or through downstream services.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-001-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-009-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-013-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-014-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">d-public-001&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-009&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-013&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-014</data>
      <data key="d5">1793369436</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Project Bilfael">
      <data key="d0">Project Bilfael</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">A project built on the Fibrasine Relay. Its progress is supported by the health of the Fibrasine Relay, and the project team maintains regular communication with the platform's operators.&lt;SEP&gt;A project with a services contract with Kremarel Partners, involving coordination between equipment delivery and service support.&lt;SEP&gt;Project Bilfael is an analytics project led by Givien Mubren and is separate from the Dankenor Analytics Unit's budget and ownership.&lt;SEP&gt;A project at Zastama Industries focused on maintaining narrow and clear goals to ensure deliverability and alignment with other teams.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-001-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-003-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-010-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-015-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">d-public-001&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-003&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-010&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-015</data>
      <data key="d5">1793350331</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Fonathe Platform Group">
      <data key="d0">Fonathe Platform Group</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">A group that operates on an annual budget of $4.1M. It is responsible for the ongoing running and improvement of the platforms it looks after.&lt;SEP&gt;A technical support group based at the Brerponen Annex, providing shared technical foundations for other teams.&lt;SEP&gt;A group within Zastama Industries responsible for fleet telemetry and related data collection and availability.&lt;SEP&gt;An organization responsible for publishing a brief guide on how teams can submit fleet telemetry requests.&lt;SEP&gt;The Fonathe Platform Group is responsible for fleet telemetry, including the pipelines, collection services, and supporting systems that gather operational signals from the deployed fleet and make them usable by the rest of the company. It operates on an annual budget of $4.1M and maintains tooling for the wider organization.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-001-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-003-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-005-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-005-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-014-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">d-public-001&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-003&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-005&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-014</data>
      <data key="d5">1793369436</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Zosu Kistos">
      <data key="d0">Zosu Kistos</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Zosu Kistos is an employee of Zastama Industries who has been with the company since 2020. She reports to Leroror Lukaine and is part of the organizational structure that includes individuals such as Fallem Purraren, who also fall under the same reporting line. Zosu Kistos plays a key role in the coordination of the Trebrula Beacon launch and serves as a point of contact for approvals and questions related to her area of work. Her responsibilities include managing recurring approvals for the restricted access group, a task she has handled for the longest period within the company.

Zosu Kistos is also a member of the Dankenor Analytics Unit at Zastama Industries, where she contributes to the integration of data analysis and engineering practices. However, she is noted as an example of a reporting relationship that exists outside this unit, highlighting the broader scope of her role within the organization. Due to her long tenure and deep familiarity with the company's evolving programs, she is consulted by the committee for historical context regarding audit findings and escrow arrangements. Her work is subject to decision-making and approval by Leroror Lukaine, reinforcing the hierarchical structure within Zastama Industries.&lt;SEP&gt;A member of the Dankenor Analytics Unit at Zastama Industries.&lt;SEP&gt;Supports Leroror Lukaine in the day-to-day coordination of Project Nuzeor.&lt;SEP&gt;Zosu Kistos is an individual who reports to Leroror Lukaine. Zosu is part of the organizational structure for escalation paths within Zastama Industries.&lt;SEP&gt;A staff member who joined Zastama Industries in 2020 and is part of a review sample for vault credential records.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-001-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-006-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-012-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-015-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-016-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-017-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-008-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-009-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-007-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-011-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-014-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-006-chunk-000</data>
