    <node id="Kimmoine Annex">
      <data key="d0">Kimmoine Annex</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">A coastal site where Zastama Industries receives equipment delivered by Kremarel Partners.&lt;SEP&gt;A facility receiving equipment deliveries from Kremarel Partners. It is a site that depends on these deliveries for operations.&lt;SEP&gt;A location in Zastama Industries' footprint that has been in operation since 2014. It hosts several people and systems, including the Fibrasine Relay. It serves as a physical site for on-site coordination and infrastructure hosting.&lt;SEP&gt;A location within Zastama Industries where Givien Mubren is based and where site coordination and information distribution were discussed.&lt;SEP&gt;The Kimmoine Annex is the location where the Fibrasine Relay is hosted. It is physically separate from the location where the telemetry group works.</data>
