      <data key="d2">A vendor with a 36-month master services agreement with Zastama Industries. The agreement is up for renewal in Q2 FY27.&lt;SEP&gt;An external vendor with a $3.4M contract to support Project Siduris.&lt;SEP&gt;A vendor organization contracted to deliver equipment to the Tegurine Annex under a $3.4M contract.&lt;SEP&gt;Satisen Labs is a vendor with a contract worth $3.4M, making it one of the more significant commitments in the portfolio being reviewed by the Program Oversight Committee.</data>
