    <node id="Project Stebril">
      <data key="d0">Project Stebril</data>
      <data key="d1">project</data>
      <data key="d2">Project Stebril is a project led by Berruan Zenresan and owned by the Dankenor Analytics Unit. It is built on the Lagemett Ledger and is part of the preparations for the Trebrula Beacon launch.&lt;SEP&gt;A project at Zastama Industries with an approved budget of $7.2M and a services contract with Misginine Systems.&lt;SEP&gt;A project at Zastama Industries led by Berruan Zenresan.</data>
