      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Krilfia Mukela reports to Berruan Zenresan and supports the day-to-day delivery of Project Stebril. They handle a large share of the hands-on coordination and maintain working notes.&lt;SEP&gt;Solutions Architect at Zastama Industries, involved in technical design and coordination with the Fonathe Platform Group.&lt;SEP&gt;Krilfia Mukela is a member of the Dankenor Analytics Unit and reports to no one within the unit. She is the person to contact for telemetry requests that require a decision or a priority call.</data>
