    <node id="Munnam Furzil">
      <data key="d0">Munnam Furzil</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A member of the Dankenor Analytics Unit. Colleagues with questions about analytics work should contact Munnam Furzil for guidance on reports, data questions, and decision-making context.&lt;SEP&gt;A manager at Zastama Industries to whom Pivoine Geltoett reports, involved in cross-team decision-making.&lt;SEP&gt;Munnam Furzil is a Solutions Architect and a member of the Dankenor Analytics Unit. They are responsible for advising on how data, tools, and models should fit together and are the person to approach for technical architectural guidance.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-009-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-016-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-017-chunk-000</data>
