      <data key="d0">Drikres Tikrais</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A long-tenured employee who joined Zastama Industries in 2017. Drikres Tikrais is a useful person to consult about historical context, past decisions, and older initiatives within the company.&lt;SEP&gt;A UX Researcher and member of the Dankenor Analytics Unit who joined Zastama Industries in 2017 and participated in the meeting.</data>
