    <node id="Project Rakresett">
      <data key="d0">Project Rakresett</data>
      <data key="d1">project</data>
      <data key="d2">A project within Zastama Industries that is built on the Lagemett Ledger. Changes to the Lagemett Ledger can have downstream effects on this project, and planning for one should consider the other.&lt;SEP&gt;A project at Zastama Industries that has a services contract with Misginine Systems and was discussed in the meeting for coordination and governance.&lt;SEP&gt;A project supported by a services contract with Misginine Systems. The legal and procurement teams are to review the contract and master services agreement together to ensure alignment.&lt;SEP&gt;A downstream project built on the Lagemett Ledger, benefiting from and affected by changes to it.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-009-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-018-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-008-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-011-chunk-000</data>
