    <node id="Fallem Purraren">
      <data key="d0">Fallem Purraren</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">An employee at Zastama Industries who focuses on data retention tooling and reports to Leroror Lukaine.&lt;SEP&gt;The person at Zastama Industries who focuses on data retention tooling.&lt;SEP&gt;Fallem Purraren focuses on data retention tooling at Zastama Industries. This work affects storage costs, audit readiness, and the ability to answer questions about past operations. Fallem is the primary contact for data retention-related inquiries.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-015-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-007-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-014-chunk-000</data>
