    <node id="Data Retention Tooling">
      <data key="d0">Data Retention Tooling</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">A set of tools being developed to help teams manage the duration of information retention and its handling at the end of its useful life.&lt;SEP&gt;A method or system being evaluated for handling archival and deletion rules for Project Soramis.&lt;SEP&gt;A system or set of tools being developed to manage how data is retained, deleted, and archived.&lt;SEP&gt;A set of procedures and techniques used to manage the retention, deletion, and archival of data within the Paskian Platform Group at Zastama Industries.&lt;SEP&gt;Data retention tooling refers to the systems and processes used to manage how long data is stored, which affects storage costs, audit readiness, and the ability to answer questions about past operations.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-015-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-005-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-009-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-007-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-014-chunk-000</data>
