    <node id="Renzer Field Office">
      <data key="d0">Renzer Field Office</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">A field location discussed in the meeting, with a seating capacity of 240 seats.&lt;SEP&gt;The Renzer Field Office is a physical location with a seating capacity of 240, which is the central planning constraint for on-site staff during the Feltarel Relay launch period.&lt;SEP&gt;A facility with a capacity for 240 seats, being considered for seating arrangements for Project Nolaor.</data>
