    <node id="Restricted Distribution">
      <data key="d0">Restricted Distribution</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Restricted Distribution refers to the limited audience for the memo, which should not be forwarded beyond the named recipients.&lt;SEP&gt;Restricted Distribution refers to the policy that the session notes should not be forwarded outside the attendee list.&lt;SEP&gt;A communication strategy to limit the sharing of the report to a predefined audience.&lt;SEP&gt;A communication protocol ensuring that Project Pirpoan's notes and updates are shared only with attendees and sponsors, not in broader channels.&lt;SEP&gt;A classification indicating that the status report is intended only for a limited audience, including program sponsors and workstream leads.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-team_a-002-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-008-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-004-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-005-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-001-chunk-000</data>
