    <node id="Gaskergur Harbor">
      <data key="d0">Gaskergur Harbor</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">Gaskergur Harbor is a location that is the subject of an engagement, characterized by having approximately 6,300 active users, making it one of the more demanding deployments in terms of operational support.&lt;SEP&gt;A project or system being developed by the Paskian Platform Group at Zastama Industries. It is the focus of the current workstream and status report.</data>
