    <node id="Thokro Pobris">
      <data key="d0">Thokro Pobris</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A Solutions Architect who is coordinating planning alignment for Project Soramis and Project Nolaor, focusing on schedule, data retention tooling, and seating arrangements.&lt;SEP&gt;The leader of Project Siduris, providing direct oversight of day-to-day delivery and stakeholder communication.&lt;SEP&gt;Thokro Pobris is an employee who joined the company in 2023 and will be taking over part of the workload related to the restricted access group's recurring approvals.&lt;SEP&gt;A staff member who joined Zastama Industries in 2023 and was assigned vault key ID XX-6801-K.&lt;SEP&gt;A Solutions Architect working on payments reconciliation within the Gaskergur Harbor project. Thokro Pobris collaborates with engineering and finance leads to clarify reconciliation flows and contributes design notes to the team.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-team_a-005-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-004-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-008-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-006-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-001-chunk-000</data>
