    <node id="Payments Reconciliation">
      <data key="d0">Payments Reconciliation</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Payments Reconciliation is the process of matching and verifying payments, which is a focus area for Zosne Bramfa and her team.&lt;SEP&gt;A process being worked on by Thokro Pobris and the engineering team to clarify how mismatches and exceptions are handled within the Gaskergur Harbor platform.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-team_a-008-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-001-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">d-team_a-008&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-001</data>
