      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">A small group of people at Zastama Industries working on the integration effort and supported by a few reviewers. They are responsible for coordination, access management, and maintaining working notes related to the integration.&lt;SEP&gt;A team responsible for identity and access tooling, working on controlled credential handling and maintaining access to a vault key.&lt;SEP&gt;The Rishalen Integration Team is the organization responsible for developing the Barnuis Console. They are the point of contact for technical questions regarding the tool's behavior, configuration, and integration with other systems.</data>
