      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Stethe Birnaen is a person who focuses on warehouse automation at Zastama Industries. Her work involves both physical spaces and connected equipment. The access badge series assigned to her is DV-1700-A, which is used for verifying her entitlements and reviewing entry logs related to her work.&lt;SEP&gt;A key individual leading the warehouse automation focus of Project Pirpoan and responsible for drafting automation priorities.</data>
