      <data key="d0">Warehouse Operations Manager</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The Warehouse Operations Manager is one of the recipients of the memo. They are responsible for identifying floor areas, shift windows, and equipment constraints that are relevant to scheduling automation-related activities, ensuring operational continuity.</data>
