      <data key="d0">Systems Integration Lead</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The Systems Integration Lead is one of the recipients of the memo. They are responsible for outlining control systems, data feeds, and network segments involved in the automation work, and for describing dependencies in plain language for non-technical readers.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-exec-001-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">d-exec-001</data>
      <data key="d5">1793351650</data>
      <data key="d6" />
