      <data key="d0">Operational Continuity</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Operational Continuity is the principle that warehouse operations such as picking, packing, and receiving must continue without interruption. The Warehouse Operations Manager is responsible for ensuring that automation-related activities are planned with this principle in mind.</data>
