      <data key="d0">Barnuis Console</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">The Barnuis Console is the platform on which Project Kridresa is built. Changes to it, such as configuration updates or maintenance windows, can directly affect the project.&lt;SEP&gt;The Barnuis Console is a system or tool developed by the Rishalen Integration Team. It is controlled through physical and logical badges and has a large user base of about 1,900 active users. Access to it is managed through the badge series QP-9934-J.&lt;SEP&gt;A platform on which Project Kridresa is built, influencing delivery approach, staffing needs, and review activity.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-exec-003-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-006-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-009-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">d-exec-003&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-006&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-009</data>
      <data key="d5">1793468904</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
